}

### W3-18 Open a stock count on Maadi -> SC-2026-000001 DRAFT; the brush line has systemQuantity 146
# @name w3count
POST {{baseUrl}}/stock-counts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{w3token}}

{
