### W3-20 Post the count -> POSTED, difference -1; Maadi 145 (ADJUSTMENT -1, sourceCode SC-2026-000001)
# @name w3countPost
POST {{baseUrl}}/stock-counts/{{w3count.response.body.$.data.id}}/post
Authorization: Bearer {{w3token}}

### W3-21 Item card brush + Maadi -> 9 movements, quantity 145, avgCost 10.6818
