POST {{baseUrl}}/stock-counts/{{ex3count.response.body.$.data.id}}/post
Authorization: Bearer {{w3token}}

### A lineId that is not a line of this count -> 400 BAD_REQUEST, field lines.0.lineId (nothing saved)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/stock-counts/{{ex3count.response.body.$.data.id}}/lines
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{w3token}}

{
  "lines": [
    { "lineId": "not-a-line", "countedQuantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Edit the header (countDate / notes only, DRAFT)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/stock-counts/{{ex3count.response.body.$.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{w3token}}

{
  "notes": "جرد مدينة نصر - آخر الشهر"
}

### The warehouse of a count can't change -> 400 VALIDATION_FAILED ("property warehouseId should not exist")
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/stock-counts/{{ex3count.response.body.$.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{w3token}}

{
  "warehouseId": "{{w2warehouse.response.body.$.data.id}}"
}

### Type the count: 24 (= the system)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/stock-counts/{{ex3count.response.body.$.data.id}}/lines
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{w3token}}

{
  "lines": [
    {
      "lineId": "{{ex3count.response.body.$.data.lines[0].id}}",
      "countedQuantity": 24
    }
  ]
}

### Post it -> POSTED, difference "0", NO movement; Nasr City still 24
POST {{baseUrl}}/stock-counts/{{ex3count.response.body.$.data.id}}/post
Authorization: Bearer {{w3token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Stock movements (حركات المخزن)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### Movements list, newest first (filters productId, warehouseId, type, dateFrom, dateTo; paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock-movements?warehouseId={{w3nasr.response.body.$.data.id}}&type=TRANSFER_IN
Authorization: Bearer {{w3token}}

### Every SALE movement of the brush, newest first -> 3 (SI-2026-000005, SI-2026-000004, SI-2026-000001)
# dateFrom / dateTo filter movementDate = the moment the movement was written
# (when the document was posted / cancelled), not the document date.
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock-movements?productId={{w2brush.response.body.$.data.id}}&type=SALE
Authorization: Bearer {{w3token}}

### Item card Maadi at the end: quantity 145, avgCost 10.6818 (the 9 big-test movements + 6 from these samples)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stock-movements/item-card?productId={{w2brush.response.body.$.data.id}}&warehouseId={{w2warehouse.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{w3token}}
